hecking", "children": [{"id": "f4e25681-a54b-44bb-8e22-0bad2358c709", "type": "concept", "title": "Sing back"}, {"id": "ea24197a-dce9-4046-a967-9c264ad18a0f", "type": "concept", "title": "Check tonic arrivals"}, {"id": "a0e35072-b4ad-4803-ab57-c361102020d6", "type": "concept", "title": "Check leaps"}, {"id": "b3fa1bfb-3bb0-4a62-8d20-93527324ebd2", "type": "concept", "title": "Compare rhythm to meter"}], "description": "The last stage of dictation is verification, not guessing once."}]}, {"id": "bfe0b9a1-4c51-4e2c-bb5e-f0384e73b3a4", "type": "topic", "title": "Rhythmic Dictation and Notation Accuracy", "description": "Develops precise listening, counting, grouping, and notation of performed rhythms.", "children": [{"id": "97a30352-f164-4ffb-818b-b3fb8cbe6429", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Metric setup", "children": [{"id": "559d68dc-c3ae-46f9-a2e2-16364a4042bf", "type": "concept", "title": "Meter signature"}, {"id": "b187f25d-6871-4f28-aa1b-26f5455dd223", "type": "concept", "title": "Beat grouping"}, {"id": "3d7873c3-d59f-4312-914b-fb6ddcc203c0", "type": "concept", "title": "Barlines"}, {"id": "8bde22a7-d052-4caf-8e0c-a6c90b6a13b3", "type": "concept", "title": "Pickup measures"}], "description": "Students learn to choose the right beat structure before writing rhythms."}, {"id": "91f253fd-e6b5-4df6-a22b-3206bc938c01", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Dictation strategies", "children": [{"id": "e8c78118-14d3-4a09-bc42-da95c5af4a2c", "type": "concept", "title": "Tap pulse"}, {"id": "d7826776-f836-40c4-92d6-7249506f7da8", "type": "concept", "title": "Speak rhythm"}, {"id": "60dceeb4-9d44-47f5-a439-594be20259a3", "type": "concept", "title": "Mark attacks"}, {"id": "08e57d03-8ba5-4405-acac-8313afe3fcbb", "type": "concept", "title": "Fill durations"}], "description": "Rhythmic dictation improves when students separate pulse, contour, and notation decisions."}, {"id": "fedc2070-5208-4bf9-ad13-15c85136e2b0", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Notation clarity", "children": [{"id": "fea5b436-2453-4c94-9d68-1dfdd332b32d", "type": "concept", "title": "Beaming"}, {"id": "4af2b201-7e62-4f30-bf5a-7891527f20ca", "type": "concept", "title": "Ties"}, {"id": "d0c5a4fd-ea15-4192-af44-1c1ad51c7769", "type": "concept", "title": "Rests"}, {"id": "cc5f77ad-fe75-4bb1-ba53-be8151d76a79", "type": "concept", "title": "Syncopation spelling"}], "description": "Correct notation communicates musical grouping, not just arithmetic duration."}]}, {"id": "bd9546ef-770e-43aa-8c44-cf8ea15cd163", "type": "topic", "title": "Chord Quality, Bass, and Introductory Harmonic Hearing", "description": "Introduces triad qualities, chord roots, bass motion, cadential patterns, and basic harmonic awareness.", "children": [{"id": "a2254a5b-df5d-4d4c-adb2-ec3386859d53", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Triad qualities", "children": [{"id": "6f0e8f6e-03f8-4273-b1be-e8f6fc29fe4d", "type": "concept", "title": "Major"}, {"id": "dba5b3db-8d22-4e65-b73c-98d2126cc14d", "type": "concept", "title": "Minor"}, {"id": "a78e2d8c-e7fd-42ac-bc69-bc734f52962e", "type": "concept", "title": "Diminished"}, {"id": "4815f81f-3350-45b5-af86-128fa5e5e6d7", "type": "concept", "title": "Augmented"}], "description": "Chord-quality hearing supports later harmonic dictation, analysis, and ensemble tuning."}, {"id": "ce6a88ed-7ad4-46b3-81ce-5ffd7ad8c76e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Bass and root awareness", "children": [{"id": "795cdff2-386a-4a4f-9f68-b9caa0ecfab4", "type": "concept", "title": "Bass line"}, {"id": "549ac962-427a-425a-bba2-063615c0e1e4", "type": "concept", "title": "Root position"}, {"id": "99292f16-bd94-424c-978c-4f82eee9109f", "type": "concept", "title": "Inversions intro"}, {"id": "f0783aa3-a64b-429f-bef7-7cf405f9e09a", "type": "concept", "title": "Cadential bass"}], "description": "Students learn to hear the low voice and root function as separate but related tasks."}, {"id": "eb840d4f-2b54-42e1-87b0-32cb81638208", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Cadential hearing", "children": [{"id": "cadd1ce4-1a48-4340-82f8-041d085f94b2", "type": "concept", "title": "Authentic cadence"}, {"id": "b412a7c9-e4f7-4489-96b8-55842dcac996", "type": "concept", "title": "Half cadence"}, {"id": "7392b7eb-4910-4cbf-a4c5-477a9c8cccd3", "type": "concept", "title": "Plagal motion"}, {"id": "27066996-50bf-4f5f-8f15-0de455dddade", "type": "concept", "title": "I-IV-V-I patterns"}], "description": "Early harmonic work focuses on common goal points in tonal music."}]}, {"id": "b9973f91-6d0e-4cdf-86d6-5a049989de9b", "type": "topic", "title": "Ensemble Singing, Error Detection, and Peer Listening", "description": "Uses group singing and listening tasks to build independence, tuning, blend, and diagnostic ears.", "children": [{"id": "1252857f-f7d7-4cfb-8804-a863527356c5", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Singing in ensemble", "children": [{"id": "b32beb14-7278-4c86-ab38-b87b830fc6e8", "type": "concept", "title": "Unison"}, {"id": "59150d24-d791-4c42-9a09-2440d8b90447", "type": "concept", "title": "Canons"}, {"id": "f8e5a26f-8d9a-43c4-9264-ddd6053fd029", "type": "concept", "title": "Two-part singing"}, {"id": "8699499c-532a-4d18-af59-b791cbccffa6", "type": "concept", "title": "Balance and blend"}], "description": "Group work builds independence, tuning, blend, and accountability."}, {"id": "f0d70bee-fa20-465c-b425-b6158683145c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Error detection", "children": [{"id": "1e5d9154-4bd7-4cd5-85d1-4e690f7e5d6a", "type": "concept", "title": "Pitch errors"}, {"id": "5d55ac1d-1699-4615-861b-0af8386efd49", "type": "concept", "title": "Rhythm errors"}, {"id": "f11356e8-94fb-4201-ad08-55bb5955e9af", "type": "concept", "title": "Wrong contour"}, {"id": "4161d2db-8fb6-44e3-a3ae-2c9ab4cf2f03", "type": "concept", "title": "Cadence mistakes"}], "description": "Students learn to hear and name what changed between score and sound."}, {"id": "dfe216a3-76de-428d-92a2-964dda95ebe8", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Peer listening", "children": [{"id": "64adccaa-2a8a-4db6-93e9-8f56d8d47918", 